          <items xsi:type="form:FormField">
            <name>TransferFeeType</name>
            <id>794</id>
            <title>
              <key>en</key>
              <value>Fee</value>
            </title>
            <title>
              <key>fa</key>
              <value>کارمزد</value>
            </title>
            <title>
              <key>it</key>
              <value>Commissione</value>
            </title>
            <title>
              <key>pl</key>
              <value>Prowizja</value>
            </title>
            <title>
              <key>ru</key>
              <value>Комиссия</value>
            </title>
            <title>
              <key>tr</key>
              <value>Komisyon</value>
            </title>
            <title>
              <key>vi</key>
              <value>Phí ngân hàng</value>
            </title>
            <visible>true</visible>
            <enabled>true</enabled>
            <userVisible>
              <common>true</common>
            </userVisible>
            <dataPath xsi:type="form:DataPath">
              <segments>Object.TransferFeeType</segments>
            </dataPath>
            <extendedTooltip>
              <name>TransferFeeTypeExtendedTooltip</name>
              <id>796</id>
              <type>Label</type>
              <autoMaxWidth>true</autoMaxWidth>
              <autoMaxHeight>true</autoMaxHeight>
              <extInfo xsi:type="form:LabelDecorationExtInfo">
                <horizontalAlign>Left</horizontalAlign>
              </extInfo>
            </extendedTooltip>
            <contextMenu>
              <name>TransferFeeTypeContextMenu</name>
              <id>795</id>
              <autoFill>true</autoFill>
            </contextMenu>
            <type>InputField</type>
            <editMode>Enter</editMode>
            <showInHeader>true</showInHeader>
            <headerHorizontalAlign>Left</headerHorizontalAlign>
            <showInFooter>true</showInFooter>
            <extInfo xsi:type="form:InputFieldExtInfo">
              <width>8</width>
              <autoMaxWidth>true</autoMaxWidth>
              <autoMaxHeight>true</autoMaxHeight>
              <horizontalStretch>false</horizontalStretch>
              <wrap>true</wrap>
              <choiceButton>false</choiceButton>
              <quickChoice>false</quickChoice>
              <chooseType>true</chooseType>
              <typeDomainEnabled>true</typeDomainEnabled>
              <textEdit>true</textEdit>
              <choiceList>
                <presentation>
                  <key>en</key>
                  <value>BEN - Fee is charged from the transfer amount - at the expense of the beneficiary</value>
                </presentation>
                <presentation>
                  <key>fa</key>
                  <value>BEN - کارمزد از مبلغ انتقال کسر می‌شود - به هزینه ذی‌نفع</value>
                </presentation>
                <presentation>
                  <key>it</key>
                  <value>BEN - La commissione viene ritenuta dall'importo del bonifico - spese a carico del beneficiario</value>
                </presentation>
                <presentation>
                  <key>pl</key>
                  <value>BEN - Prowizja jest potrącana z wartości przelewu - na koszt odbiorcy</value>
                </presentation>
                <presentation>
                  <key>ru</key>
                  <value>BEN - Комиссия взимается из суммы перевода - за счет получателя</value>
                </presentation>
                <presentation>
                  <key>tr</key>
                  <value>BEN - Komisyon, masrafları alıcıya ait olmak üzere transfer tutarından tahsil edilir</value>
                </presentation>
                <presentation>
                  <key>vi</key>
                  <value>BEN - Phí ngân hàng tính vào số tiền chuyển - người nhận chịu</value>
                </presentation>
                <value xsi:type="core:ReferenceValue">
                  <value>Enum.TypesOfBankFeesForTransfers.EnumValue.BEN</value>
                </value>
              </choiceList>
              <choiceList>
                <presentation>
                  <key>en</key>
                  <value>SHA - Fee is paid together: payer - commission of his or her bank, the rest is paid by a recipient</value>
                </presentation>
                <presentation>
                  <key>fa</key>
                  <value>SHA - کارمزد به‌صورت مشترک پرداخت می‌شود: پرداخت‌کننده - کارمزد بانک خود، باقی توسط دریافت‌کننده پرداخت می‌شود</value>
                </presentation>
                <presentation>
                  <key>it</key>
                  <value>SHA - La commissione viene condivisa tra le due: la commissione della propria banca - a carico del pagatore, altre spese - a carico del beneficiario</value>
                </presentation>
                <presentation>
                  <key>pl</key>
                  <value>SHA - Prowizja jest opłacana wspólnie; płatnik - opłaca prowizję swojego banku, pozostałą część - odbiorca</value>
                </presentation>
                <presentation>
                  <key>ru</key>
                  <value>SHA - Комиссия оплачивается совместно: плательщик - комиссию своего банка, остальное - получатель</value>
                </presentation>
                <presentation>
                  <key>tr</key>
                  <value>SHA - Komisyon ortaklaşa ödenir: ödeyen - bankasının ücreti, alıcı - geri kalanı</value>
                </presentation>
                <presentation>
                  <key>vi</key>
                  <value>SNA - Phí ngân hàng được trả chung: người trả tiền - Phí ngân hàng của ngân hàng của anh ta, phần còn lại - người nhận</value>
                </presentation>
                <value xsi:type="core:ReferenceValue">
                  <value>Enum.TypesOfBankFeesForTransfers.EnumValue.SHA</value>
                </value>
              </choiceList>
              <choiceList>
                <presentation>
                  <key>en</key>
                  <value>OUR - Fee charged from the payer, over transfer amount</value>
                </presentation>
                <presentation>
                  <key>fa</key>
                  <value>OUR - کارمزد از پرداخت‌کننده، مازاد بر مبلغ انتقال دریافت می‌شود</value>
                </presentation>
                <presentation>
                  <key>it</key>
                  <value>OUR - La commissione è a carico del pagatore - oltre all'importo del bonifico</value>
                </presentation>
                <presentation>
                  <key>pl</key>
                  <value>OUR - Prowizja na koszt płatnika - powyżej wartości przelewu</value>
                </presentation>
                <presentation>
                  <key>ru</key>
                  <value>OUR - Комиссия за счет плательщика - сверх суммы перевода</value>
                </presentation>
                <presentation>
                  <key>tr</key>
                  <value>OUR - Masrafları ödeyene ait olmak üzere komisyon - transfer tutarını aşan</value>
                </presentation>
                <presentation>
                  <key>vi</key>
                  <value>OUR - Phí ngân hàng người trả tiền chịu - cộng thêm vào số tiền chuyển</value>
                </presentation>
                <value xsi:type="core:ReferenceValue">
                  <value>Enum.TypesOfBankFeesForTransfers.EnumValue.OUR</value>
                </value>
              </choiceList>
              <choiceHistoryOnInput>DontUse</choiceHistoryOnInput>
            </extInfo>
          </items>
